  "source": {
    "html": "<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>App shell</title>\n<!--\n  Three cases from a real dashboard import (see docs/notes/import-parity-log.md):\n  a grid laid out by named areas, a logo whose short form is hidden at this\n  width, and controls sized by the author inside wrappers that hug them.\n-->\n<style>\n  body { margin: 0; font: 14px/20px system-ui, sans-serif; }\n  .shell { display: grid; grid-template-areas: \"nav centre panel\"; grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, 1fr) 360px; min-height: 600px; }\n  .sidebar { grid-area: nav; background: #eef3f9; padding: 24px 16px; }\n  .centre { grid-area: centre; padding: 24px; }\n  .panel { grid-area: panel; background: #f5f8fc; padding: 24px; }\n  .logo-name { font-weight: 700; }\n  .logo-short { display: none; }\n  .tools { display: flex; gap: 8px; }\n  .anchor { position: relative; display: flex; }\n  .icon-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 40px; height: 40px; padding: 0; border: 1px solid #d9e2ee; border-radius: 50%; background: transparent; }\n  .icon-button svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }\n  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 40px; padding: 0 16px; border: 1px solid #7a8aa1; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; font: 600 14px/20px system-ui, sans-serif; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .avatar { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e6f4fc; font-weight: 600; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"shell\">\n    <nav class=\"sidebar\">\n      <p class=\"logo\"><span class=\"logo-name\">Resova iQ</span><span class=\"logo-short\" aria-hidden=\"true\">iQ</span></p>\n    </nav>\n    <main class=\"centre\">\n      <button class=\"button\" type=\"button\">Upload audio</button>\n      <span class=\"avatar\">PR</span>\n    </main>\n    <aside class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"tools\">\n        <div class=\"anchor\">\n          <button class=\"icon-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Theme\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n\n\n</body></html>",
    "css": "/* <style> */\nbody { margin: 0px; font: 14px / 20px system-ui, sans-serif; }\n.shell { display: grid; grid-template-areas: \"nav centre panel\"; grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0px, 1fr) 360px; min-height: 600px; }\n.sidebar { grid-area: nav; background: rgb(238, 243, 249); padding: 24px 16px; }\n.centre { grid-area: centre; padding: 24px; }\n.panel { grid-area: panel; background: rgb(245, 248, 252); padding: 24px; }\n.logo-name { font-weight: 700; }\n.logo-short { display: none; }\n.tools { display: flex; gap: 8px; }\n.anchor { position: relative; display: flex; }\n.icon-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 40px; height: 40px; padding: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 226, 238); border-radius: 50%; background: transparent; }\n.icon-button svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }\n.button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 40px; padding: 0px 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(122, 138, 161); border-radius: 12px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font: 600 14px / 20px system-ui, sans-serif; white-space: nowrap; }\n.avatar { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(230, 244, 252); font-weight: 600; }",
    "unreadable": [],
